# Proxy Gateway Plus 标准安装接口参数示例。允许的 key 与编排器当前白名单完全一致。
# 本文件故意全部注释，不能直接 deploy；复制为 proxy-gateway-plus.env 后按项目说明填写。
# 尖括号内容只是占位符，不能作为实例值。Token、用户 ID、域名和真实 IP 不得提交。
#
# PDG_SERVER_IP=<replace-with-server-public-ip>
# PDG_SSH_PORT=<replace-with-ssh-port>
# PDG_INTERNAL_CIDR=<replace-with-client-source-cidr>
# PDG_PLATFORM=<replace-with-supported-platform>
# PDG_FIREWALL_MODE=external
# PDG_QUIC_MODE=<replace-with-supported-mode>
# PDG_QUIC_MARK=<replace-with-reviewed-mark>
# PDG_QUIC_MARK_MASK=<replace-with-reviewed-mark-mask>
# PDG_QUIC_ROUTE_TABLE=<replace-with-reviewed-route-table>
# PDG_QUIC_RULE_PRIORITY=<replace-with-reviewed-rule-priority>
# PDG_HIJACK_MODE=<replace-with-supported-mode>
# PDG_HIJACK_TLS_TCP_PORTS=<replace-with-reviewed-port-list>
# PDG_HIJACK_HTTP_TCP_PORTS=<replace-with-reviewed-port-list>
# PDG_BOT_TOKEN=<replace-with-secret-bot-token>
# PDG_ALLOWED=<replace-with-authorized-user-id>
# PDG_DOT_DOMAIN=<replace-with-instance-domain>
# PDG_SKIP_CERT=<replace-with-supported-value>
# PDG_LOWMEM=<replace-with-supported-value>
# PDG_REPO_URL=https://github.com/SchweppesSoda/proxy-gateway-plus.git
#
# PDG_FIREWALL_MODE 必须显式为 external。PDG_NONINTERACTIVE 由编排器注入，不是本文件白名单 key。
